549   8339              ; Spectrum display and keyboard control.
550   8339              ; RST 10h is the Spectrum ROM PRINT-OUT entry (current channel #2).
551   8339              ; SPACE is bit 0 of keyboard row 7F7F, active low.
552   8339              ; -------------------------------------------------------------------------
553   8339              SpectrumPrint:
554   8339 7E                   LD      A,(HL)
555   833A B7                   OR      A
556   833B C8                   RET     Z
557   833C D7                   RST     $10
558   833D 23                   INC     HL
559   833E 18 F9                JR      SpectrumPrint
